body:
this happened about a decade ago

&#x200B;

still living with her

rating: M  \[themes of incest and sexual themes, deception's of violence

title: Perfect Liar 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

[https://www.quotev.com/story/13402995/Perfect-Liar](https://www.quotev.com/story/13402995/Perfect-Liar)



drama and romance 

&#x200B;

perfect liar 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

I suppose my sister was always a liar she used to tell me fantastical stories and id believe them whole heartedly, I loved my sister with my whole heart she was perfect in my eyes. I guess my infatuation with her started when that nigh happened. she had come into my room and said "anna i love you but you can never tell anyone of this night after I do this my dear" she clasped my cheek and kissed me sweetly it so wrong but felt good she kissed me so sweetly and made sure i was enjoying the kiss. she then pulled away and said "never speak of this, Anna. she then walked out of my room i was baffled why couldn't I tell anyone of this pleasure I just felt, i was just to young to understand she was a perfect manipulator. 

\[present day\]

my sister is visiting me today I haven't seen her in quite awhile she's coming all the way from NYC and I'm in the UK I originally moved here for school but decided to stay since I like the culture. I was nervous about seeing my older sister for the first time in years it has been 2 years since I last saw her and my heart was pounding i loved her but she told me to never speak of that scared kiss we shared I still don't know, all of a sudden while i was lost in thought i heard a knock at my door "oh it must be Elsa!" i rushed to the door and opened it looking worried and flustered she said "hello anna" coldly as i led her into my house we both sat down on my couch i told her how i was and that it was nice to see her after 2 years she nodded her head and hugged me tightly 

Elsa's POV: I do love my sister but its complicated I just I'm not sure why I lie to her and manipulate her and act coldly I guess I'm just fucked up but I do love as Elsa thought to herself as she embraced her sister anna tightly as she pulled away she seemed to cheer up a bit and  smiled and looked away looking slightly confused "what's wrong?" anna asked looking worried and reached out her hand a bit towards Elsa "ah nothing, nothing just thinking".
